on":"Where are vegetables, pulses and fuel and light?","answer":"In COICOP-2018 vegetables are published as five sub-classes (leafy, fruit-bearing, green leguminous, other vegetables, tubers) and the class 'Vegetables, tubers, plantains, cooking bananas and pulses' also includes pulses; 'Pulses' and 'Cereals' are published as separate sub-classes.^The old 'Fuel and light' group no longer exists: 'Electricity, gas and other fuels' is a group within division 4. These are close but not identical in coverage to the 2012-base groups, so do not splice them."},{"question":"Caveats?","answer":"History starts in January 2025 only; year-on-year rates are available from January 2026 and are not computed here. Latest values are provisional. Individual sub-classes can be volatile (seasonal vegetables especially).^Source detail: MoSPI's eSankhyiki portal serves this data from api.mospi.gov.in; sub-class and class indices are published at All-India level for each sector."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:09:42+00:00"}